{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121000417665-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121130015\"/><p>大埔發生交通意外。昨晚（20日）11時許，一輛私家車沿大發街往工業邨方向行駛，至大埔海濱公園對開一彎位時失控，猛撞路中消防閘後翻轉，四輪朝天。姓李(29歲)男司機與同姓李(25歲)女乘客事後自行爬出車外，當中女乘客報稱肚痛由救護車送院治理，李男通過酒精呼氣測試，在場助查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T05:24:02.843066+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:04:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:17.314829+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T05:17:14.425988+00:00","content_hash":"84857f7a80a14a5c1c5df0003bef06457102af3a8f0ad9046272ea95630f0d99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}